 "description": "\"Drug target profile for [gene]\" / \"is [gene] a druggable target\" / \"[gene] target info\" / \"target ID [ENSG...]\" \u2014 fetch a drug-target profile (Open Targets uses Ensembl gene IDs as target identifiers). Returns approved symbol, name, biotype, protein IDs, pathways, synonyms. Use for target characterization in drug discovery.",
